   129	## What stays withheld
   130	
   131	Only the two private tests, seen by nobody, and the read reopened on the floor; no log line calls any of it deployment. Shadow untouched. The word the line will later be given does not occur. "Made" is said once, by Karis, and the narration says nothing of who or how. The stake's stamp is "the registry's". Oryn reads nobody inside. No hound is seen. No name is minted. "Nineteen" does not occur. No season, month or weekday.
