+
+All are present once, in the assigned place and exact map wording:
+
+- Traverse and price; Fallow slip and seal; Pike's full speech, refusal count and line answer (`manuscript/chapter-24.md:75-95,131-175,253-259`; `BOOK_MAP.md:245-246,305`).
