+- Vell's whole letter, the five rise lines, “Same stride,” and the day-95 log (`manuscript/chapter-27.md:57,193-213,235-239`; `BOOK_MAP.md:265,279,306`).
+- The three perimeter figures and two stake lines (`manuscript/chapter-28.md:197-213,223-235`; `BOOK_MAP.md:307`).
