+- Karis on the bands, Seln on the den, and the far-lip log (`manuscript/chapter-30.md:91-95,189-193,223-225`; `BOOK_MAP.md:280,307`).
+
+The two Quiet-line logs retain the owner-protected loose “mine” wording exactly (`manuscript/chapter-27.md:237`; `manuscript/chapter-30.md:225`; `OWNER-DECISIONS.md:154-157`). The Fallow slip, both letters and all three protected logs are each printed once; later references are narration rather than a second document printing (`manuscript/chapter-24.md:131`; `manuscript/chapter-26.md:59-73`; `manuscript/chapter-27.md:57,237`; `manuscript/chapter-30.md:225`). Pike's full unit is the only partial-map unit whose protected content was also composed outside its marker, and fix 4 removes that duplication (`books/book-07-void-roads/chapters/chapter-08.md:171`; `manuscript/chapter-25.md:47`).
+
